            %strong subspace topology
            on
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Y
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Y
          %p
            A continuous function that factors as a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homeomorphism"} homeomorphism
            onto its
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/image"} image
            equipped with the subspace topology is called an
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/embedding+of+topological+spaces"} embedding of topological spaces
            = succeed "." do
